{
 "header": [
  "The page's plan for N64Recomp-browser's tools/play_page.mjs, its regular play of 2-3 minutes: the launcher, Load ROM",
  "on a new profile once the shader list Chrome builds behind the launcher is done (Firefox builds none there, and its",
  "line saying so is the one waited for), Start Game, 15 s of the logos and the title, then Start (Enter) to the main",
  "menu and GP Race with A (Space), through machine select and the machine's settings, as a player does. The course is",
  "set at machine select, where the race reads it (gCourseIndex, 0x800F8514), and once the race starts the computer",
  "drives player 1's machine (RACER_STATE_CPU_CONTROLLED in gRacers[0]'s flags, 0x802C4924), so every play goes as far",
  "whatever the browser, nudged left and right by the stick (A, D). Its waits and holds are on the game's own frame",
  "counter, gGameFrameCount (0x800CCFE0, 60 a second), each behind a need that fails the run unless the game is in a",
  "race (gGameMode, 0x800DCE44) on that course.",
  "Mute City, then the pause menu's Quit to the main menu and Rainbow Road, a minute",
  "of each."
 ],
